      "text": "Ibuprofen for RA and OA:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " 1,200 mg to 3,200 mg daily (300 mg four times a day, or 400 mg, 600 mg or 800 mg three or four times a day). Do not exceed 3,200 mg total daily dose."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
